        "TileImage": "$($repository 9edd63dc-1256-4d42-bcf6-5acd53851829).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47.\r\rToday, we’ve secured a very special contract in familiar territory, you are to take out four targets who are all trying to move up the cartel ranks.\r\rOur client has information indicating that all our targets are going to cause catastrophic damage to both people and the environment. It is therefore crucial that we dismantle the cartel before they can regroup under even worse leadership.\r\rI&apos;ll leave you to prepare.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
